      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "「生之执政」纳贝里士"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/08/326985891/3547e5e471d4f65c9e84c863e408d4a0_500770909195751936.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年7月9日</color>\n「我的权能落在你手上，好像彻底沦为满足你兴趣的玩物了呢。」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "「死之执政」若娜瓦"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/08/326985891/2e80aed4d6ebac4eb880311a4a357409_7603960841922374954.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年7月9日</color>\n「唉…好了，我准备宣告这个空间的『死亡』咯？」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "「时之执政」伊斯塔露"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/44577d049ffc115dfdbbfd3306fee616_643184730875022646.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年7月9日</color>\n「那些徒劳无用的时间…总要想些办法来打发。」"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物关系"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4897,
        "name": "原初的那一位",
        "desc": "<p>第一位降临者，击败了世间的七位龙王，并创造了人类。原初的那一位或许便是「法涅斯」。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/513d51e0ebfd54f5da34a9f85dfaf61f_3593056138001658182.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "与",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7084,
        "name": "元素龙",
        "desc": "<p>在人类出现之前，就统治着提瓦特大陆很久的一个古老种族。龙族属于光界。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/01/18/326985891/93cd2bc9b90c8b87b1f8cbdbe95b4b9d_3605642606274730791.png",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的战争结束后，原初的那一位创造了四个发着光的影子。她们一同重塑了提瓦特大陆，并创造了人类。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名影子"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7039,
        "name": "若娜瓦",
        "desc": "<p>死之执政，是原初的那一位影子之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/fe101061601cffd0f2d7ed5b1cf58bc6_2351762000668717154.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "死之执政，在她的引领下，夜神之国得以建立，纳塔的规则亦随之确立。据说，她的作为已远超影子的权限，这也触怒了「天理」。借助纳塔的神座便可动用若娜瓦的力量，而使用这份力量的代价，便是死亡。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8237,
        "name": "纳贝里士",
        "desc": "<p>生之执政，是「天理」的四个影子之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/c7f2e5bc55b69c5a956a30e26dd5f4e7_8304957438263499487.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "生之执政，遭",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 6368,
        "name": "莱茵多特",
        "desc": "<p>艾莉丝的好友，阿贝多的师父及制作者，被称为「黄金」的女性炼金术士。坎瑞亚的贤者与首席炼金术师，坎瑞亚的「五大罪人」之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/09/07/59155606/02619155b165c5a6ed0109b4b61c9ad7_2159470782819424628.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "吞噬。她并未消逝，而是与“罪人”融为了一体。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4898,
        "name": "伊斯塔露",
        "desc": "<p>时之执政，又名为常世大神、「千风之神」，和卡伊洛斯，「不变世界的统领与执政」。她是原初的那一位影子之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/07/326985891/6c6230d12f0386d6d86e680bd88d4398_8454218153591000583.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "时之执政和「不变世界的统领与执政」。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7094,
        "name": "阿斯莫代",
        "desc": "<p>分离了旅行者与血亲的「天理」维系者，亦是四个影子之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/10/326985891/ae74ebeeaf9cf4b5b68c2f88f0e42362_7455080447012141087.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "分离了",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 20,
        "name": "旅行者",
        "desc": "从世界之外漂流而来的旅行者，被神带走血亲，自此踏上寻找七神之路。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/05/22/327628065/04f769b0b1671b5ffbbafefd7286b4b2_8705621070531496665.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "与",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7851,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的空之执政。其他影子寻不到她的踪迹，认为她或许已然叛变，且爱新的主人胜过爱自己。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "相关书籍"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 882,
        "name": "日月前事",
        "desc": "禁止一般人接触的编年史，写法混杂了寓言和纪年。从开天辟地写到了大日御舆落成。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/03/03/142453215/26a07b7e3f94ae3d15179c5125262553_2755985615723329264.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      }
    ]
  }
